                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "You play as Tirna—a spirited, red-haired young woman facing a long and perilous journey across uncharted lands to avenge her father’s death and rescue caravan members who have been enslaved. You are young, ambitious, and skilled with a sword, yet inexperienced—leaving you prone to making fatal mistakes. Fortunately, fate brings you together with Gavin, a wanderer of elven descent. Now you face a choice: entrust your life to this stranger, set out in search of the caravan alone, or ask the elf for help and leave your fate to chance.",
